WEBVTT

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.360
<i>Hanamaru Kindergarten</i>

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:31.790
Good morning, sensei.

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:33.460
Tsuchi!

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:36.760
Oh, Anzu.

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:39.610
Look at how tanned I got!

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:41.360
That's quite a tan.

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:42.470
Me, too!

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:44.310
You're tan too, Ryota.

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:47.440
You two must have had a lot of fun over summer vacation.

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:48.060
Yeah!

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:49.450
I had lots of fun, too!

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:50.560
I see.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:55.730
Summer vacation was fun, but I missed you.

00:01:56.770 --> 00:01:57.890
I see...

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:00.060
I brought you a souvenir from Australia.

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:02.060
It's a koala.

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:05.700
These are the astronomical landscape photographs I took with my father.

00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:09.380
Astronomical landscapes? You mean photographs of landscapes and stars?

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:12.210
They're beautiful. I'd expect as much from you, master.

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:14.440
I don't know how I feel about being called...

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:17.450
Master, I want you call you "master!"

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:18.540
But...

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.210
"A Hanamaru Fishmonger"

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:21.840
"Sakura Class"

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:21.830
Okay, everyone.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:24.300
"My Summer Vacation"

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:24.300
Did you all finish drawing your summer vacations?

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:25.760
Yes.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:30.450
I caught a rhinoceros beetle. It was huge!

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:30.020
"Great Catch"

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:31.890
Wow, that's great.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.370
Looks like you drew a trip to the beach.

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:38.940
Yeah. I went with my daddy and mommy. It was fun!

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:40.860
You drew a fireworks festival.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.790
Is that a museum?

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:47.330
I visited the transportation museum with my father.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.140
I see. That must have been fun.

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:50.790
I drew this.

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:55.480
Did you draw a picture of your parents working?

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:56.330
Yeah.

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:58.850
This isn't a drawing of your summer vacation.

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:00.160
You're not even in it.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.000
Hey.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:05.440
We couldn't take time off from work, so we didn't go anywhere, but...

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:11.440
Come one, come all! Summer is bonito season! We've got some lively ones!

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:17.470
My parents are cool when they work.

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:18.740
I see.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.100
Hey, city kid!

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:23.450
I go to Aoi-chan's store with my brother all the time.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:24.700
Thank you.

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:30.930
My parents won't let me work in the store yet. They say I'm too young.

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:32.440
But you're so good at that.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.880
I can do that.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:36.630
What? Really?

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:37.940
Of course I can.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.830
Aoi-chan, do it again!

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:41.110
Okay.

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:45.600
Come one, come all! We've got some great yellowtail today!

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:50.760
What do you say, lady? These delicious and fatty Kagoshima-grown yellowtails are in season!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.550
Bye-bye, sensei.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.520
See you tomorrow.

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:00.940
Anzu-chan, Koume-chan, Hii-chan, bye-bye.

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:03.610
Your mommy isn't here yet, Aoi-chan.

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:06.440
My mom's got a meeting and can't come today.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:10.070
In that case, why don't you wait? We'll go home together.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.380
I'm fine by myself. Besides, I live nearby.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:13.230
Bye!

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:14.640
Hey, wait!

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:26.340
Aoi-chan didn't get to go anywhere over summer vacation, and she has to go home by herself.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.630
I wonder if she's lonely.

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:32.200
About that...

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:35.170
"Fresh Fish"

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.160
Thank you, sensei.

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:36.660
You've been a big help.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:37.760
It's no trouble.

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:41.890
Sashimi today, ma'am? We've got some great tuna.

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.610
I'll have some of that, then.

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:44.930
We appreciate your business.

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:48.430
Welcome! Would you like some tuna too, ma'am?

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:51.780
Your father is a real pro at this.

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:52.820
I know, right?

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:56.800
I know, sensei. Why don't you take this with you?

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.110
Oh, thank you.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:02.790
Bye.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:04.050
See you later.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.960
What am I going to do with this?

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:10.170
I can't cook a fish this big.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.640
Dad, let me help today.

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:15.890
You can't. Get inside.

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:18.260
You're so mean.

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:19.700
You're still just a kid.

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:25.810
Welcome!

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.590
I can help.

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:38.150
Excuse me.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.120
Welcome.

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:43.610
Could I get three of those sauries, squid and sea urchin?

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:45.790
I also need five sashimi platters.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.910
Oh? You're getting quite a lot today.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:50.670
Yes. We all love fish.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:54.130
Mommy, this man is cool.

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:56.560
You could be right.

00:05:56.720 --> 00:06:01.550
He's a man among men who takes pride in his work.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:02.750
Very cool.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.060
Hey, that's enough.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:09.930
My mommy said she liked this man's sincerity, too.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:11.130
Really?

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:14.300
Flattering me won't get you anything.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:17.150
Though, I suppose I could give you a thirty percent discount.

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:19.280
Oh, you're so wonderful!

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:23.660
"Wonderful?" No one's called me wonderful before.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:26.130
Alright, here's some octopus and flatfish on the house.

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:31.450
Oh, no. I forgot my wallet.

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:34.170
I'm sorry. I'll go home and get it.

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:35.930
I could just stick it on your bill.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.990
I couldn't do that.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:42.480
I'll be back soon. I'll leave the munchkins here with you.

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:43.680
Okay.

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:45.790
Thanks for watching them.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.050
Be good!

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.460
What a strange customer.

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:56.340
Why don't you head inside the store, girls?

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:57.860
I'll get you something to snack on.

00:06:57.860 --> 00:07:03.000
I want to eat snacks, but I want to watch you work, too!

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:05.140
Me, too.

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:06.900
We won't get in your way.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:07.790
But...

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:12.300
I want to get a closer look at your awesome work!

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:15.890
There you go again. I wouldn't say I'm awesome.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.400
Alright. I guess you can watch.

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:19.800
Thank you.

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:22.810
We'll even help you, too.

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:25.590
Help me? You don't need to...

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:28.550
Excuse me, could I get some yellowtail?

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:30.550
Yellowtail, right?

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:32.350
We've got some great ones.

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:34.310
Hey, miss...

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:35.830
It's alright.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:38.260
What's going on, honey?

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:41.380
Well, these little girls...

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.510
Is this what you want?

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:44.600
Yes, it is.

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.340
That will be 100 yen per fish.

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:48.680
What cute fishmongers.

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:54.020
Yellowtail is rich in unsaturated fatty acids including DHA and EPA.

00:07:54.020 --> 00:08:01.000
DHA and EPA are healthy fatty acids that lower cholesterol and improve circulation.

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:06.460
Welcome!

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:08.290
Thank you for your business.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:13.580
Dad and mom are loud today, too.

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.610
Welcome! How can I help you?

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:17.750
Huh? That voice...

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:24.810
Come get your delicious fish!

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:25.740
Welcome.

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.740
We've got some great bonito today.

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:32.240
What can we get for you today?

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:33.530
Anzu-chan.

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:35.530
Aoi-chan.

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.540
You know my Aoi, miss?

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:40.730
I know her. We're in the same class.

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:42.180
What are you doing here?

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:45.540
Looks like you've been taken in.

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:47.570
You're weak to flattery.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:48.790
Shut up!

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:50.600
You should join us, Aoi-chan.

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:52.910
Aoi's still too...

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:56.200
But you let us help you.

00:08:57.940 --> 00:09:00.030
Why can't Aoi-chan help?

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.660
We were able to help you...

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:08.230
...and I'm sure Aoi-chan, who always watches you work, would be even better than us.

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:24.750
I can't say no to you girls.

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:28.400
Alright, Aoi. Get changed.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:29.680
Okay!

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:34.830
Come one, come all! We've got some lively fish!

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.690
We've only got tasty fish!

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:37.740
Welcome.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:40.620
Fish is good for you.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:41.460
How cute.

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:43.530
Maybe I'll make fish for dinner tonight.

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:45.060
It's delicious!

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:47.490
What are you guys doing?

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.890
Oh, Ryota.

00:09:48.890 --> 00:09:50.280
We're helping around the store.

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:52.680
You're helping?

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:54.400
Why don't you have some saury tonight?

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:57.190
Our saury is rich from tip to tail.

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:58.590
That does look good.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.930
Not only is saury cheap, but it's also nutritious.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:03.220
It'll give you healthy blood.

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:05.500
Really? I'll take some, then.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.340
Thank you.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.510
Aoi-chan's great at this.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:09.720
I knew she could do it.

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:10.720
Wow.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:14.510
She's been watching us work.

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:19.380
I didn't let her help because I thought children should play...

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:21.520
...but I must have been overthinking it.

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:26.290
She said she wanted to help every day over summer vacation.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:33.700
She asked to let her help, but she never asked to be taken anywhere.

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:39.400
I guess I could take her to the amusement park when the marketplace is closed.

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:40.330
Dad.

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:43.640
The customer wants her mackerel cut into three pieces.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.780
Got it! Leave it to me.

00:10:54.790 --> 00:10:55.980
"Sakura Class"

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.270
What are you doing, Aoi-chan?

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:05.870
Nothing. By the way, my dad said I could help out at the store today, too.

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:07.710
That's great, Aoi-chan.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.020
That's great.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:10.570
Thank you.

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:13.760
You did a great job, Aoi-chan.

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.690
I could do that.

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:18.460
It's not easy to be a pro.

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:20.790
I can do it.

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:23.370
I kind of want to try it.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:28.130
Why don't you come over today, then? My dad's a tough boss, though.

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:29.400
I can handle it.

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:31.830
Welcome! We've got delicious fish!

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:32.810
You've got to be louder than that.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:34.570
Welcome, welcome!

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.220
Oh, dear.

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:46.630
What's the matter?

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:53.990
Oh, your clog thong broke.

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:56.500
Yes.

00:11:59.430 --> 00:12:02.910
Thank you. I hate to ask a passerby for help...

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:04.500
Don't worry about it.

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:09.370
I wish I could have repaired your clog, but I'm not any good at that.

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:12.200
I see.

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:13.420
"Macho Clan"

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:18.280
This is your house?

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:19.400
Yes.

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:21.140
"A Hanamaru Rival"

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:24.310
Hey, you're that litterbug.

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:26.530
It's that boss.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:30.200
Thank you for all your help.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:34.270
Father, this man helped me.

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:36.160
This guy did?

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:39.280
Thank you. Why don't you have some tea?

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:42.540
Tea? Oh, I don't need any.

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:45.050
Are you saying you can't accept the boss' hospitality?

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:47.500
I just didn't want to cause any trouble.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:50.430
It's no trouble at all.

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:54.480
Father, you're a very intense person.

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:56.840
You mustn't get so close to ordinary people.

00:12:57.410 --> 00:13:00.130
And what are you two doing threatening our guest?

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:01.160
Sorry.

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:02.940
So sorry, miss!

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:05.830
This girl is scolding yakuza members.

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:13.760
I've never seen such a smile.

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:18.980
Koume-chan, catch.

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:20.180
She was wearing a kimono?

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:21.370
Yes.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:25.090
She was oddly mature. I helped her home.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.660
That place gave me quite a shock, too.

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:36.640
That's...

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.720
Who are those people?

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:39.860
Who knows?

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:51.850
Good morning, everyone.

00:13:53.090 --> 00:13:54.660
Good morning.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:59.620
I'm here to propose marriage to Tsuchida-sama.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:02.840
Anzu-chan's rival has appeared.

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:06.440
What's going on? What's this talk about marrying that girl?

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.800
That's the first I've heard of it, too!

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:11.370
Marriage?

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:12.610
Yes.

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:13.920
Are you serious?

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:14.750
Yes.

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:19.380
I've never met anyone as wonderful as Tsuchida-sama.

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:23.600
But marriage is something that comes after you get to know someone...

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.100
What did you say?

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:27.360
Are you saying you can't accept her love?

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.270
That's not what I...

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:29.890
Hey!

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.870
Haven't I told you not to threaten ordinary people?

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:34.030
Oh, sorry!

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:35.960
"Ordinary people?"

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:40.410
I thought he might say that, so I've arranged to transfer here.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:47.050
I'll attend the same preschool as Tsuchida-sama and get to know him before proposing engagement.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.380
I understand.

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:54.060
You're a second year, so we'll have you join the Sunflower Class.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:58.360
Hinagiku-chan, the Sunflower Class is this way.

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:01.680
Director, what should I do?

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:05.650
What should you do? Whatever will be, will be.

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:08.820
You should just do what you always do, Tsuchida-kun.

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:10.410
What I always do?

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:14.450
Hinagiku-chan thinks you're a wonderful person, right?

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:18.990
When she sees you coming in late and falling asleep on the job, she'll lose interest.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:20.670
I see.

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:22.420
It's a nice idea, if I do say so myself.

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:32.130
Just do what you always do.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:36.170
Miss, he's been reading those books all afternoon.

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:37.740
He's wonderful.

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:38.750
Wonderful?

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:42.450
Not only is he kind, but he's also free-spirited.

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:48.380
What's going on?

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:52.320
It seems Hinagiku-chan is going to propose to Tsuchida.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.070
Oh, is it time?

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:55.850
She's proposing?

00:15:56.440 --> 00:16:02.500
I've been observing you over the past few days, and you're exactly who I thought you would be.

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:04.540
Oh, thank you.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:07.110
You liar, Kawashiro-sensei.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:10.740
As originally planned, I'd like to court you with marriage in mind...

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:15.150
But you're still a kindergarten student. Marriage is...

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:16.520
I forbid it!

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:19.560
We should start by deciding when to exchange wedding gifts.

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:22.030
I'm going to exchange wedding gifts with Tsuchi!

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:25.360
I'd love to be a June bride.

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:27.280
I'm going to marry him!

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:31.420
You're from Tsuchida-sama's Sakura Class...

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:32.180
Anzu!

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:35.950
Your name is Anzu-chan? You're very honest and cute.

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:37.960
You think I'm cute?

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:41.260
My name is Hinagiku. It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:42.610
N-nice to meet you.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:44.860
Now, about our wedding gifts...

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:47.110
You can't do that!

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:52.000
I'm dating Tsuchi with my parents' approval!

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.700
I'm his girlfriend!

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:57.810
You're dating Tsuchida-sama?

00:16:57.930 --> 00:16:59.060
That's right.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:05.120
If you can date Anzu-chan, you should have no problem dating someone a year older.

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.340
Well...

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:10.850
No, no, no! I'm going to marry Tsuchi!

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:12.420
I've learned flower arranging, tea ceremony...

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:15.800
...and all the other essential skills of a Japanese woman.

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:18.320
I'm sure I'll make a fantastic bride.

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:22.770
If anything, a woman like that isn't suited to Tsuchida-sensei.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:24.070
I agree.

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:30.250
Why is Tsuchida so popular with children? Yamamoto-sensei doesn't show any interest in him.

00:17:30.470 --> 00:17:31.800
Yamamoto-sensei?

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:34.150
She's the first year Peach Class teacher.

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:36.570
Tsuchida is in love with Yamamoto-sensei.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:41.000
She's beautiful, glamorous, and kind. She's the perfect woman.

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:45.240
Tsuchida's just a hopeless guy who stares at Yamamoto-sensei's chest all day.

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:49.270
I understand.

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:55.610
It seems Yamamoto-sensei is an immoral tramp who deceives men with her beauty.

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:01.790
As a woman, I cannot condone her behavior.

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:03.860
I will admonish her.

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:06.870
W-wait. Hinagiku-chan?

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:08.210
My, my...

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:13.150
Just let her go. We should let Nana-chan handle her.

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:19.860
She's the one.

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:23.420
That elegant walk. She's no ordinary woman.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:25.610
Yamamoto-sensei.

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:29.340
Hello, my name is Hinagiku.

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:32.700
Hello, Hinagiku-chan.

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:39.240
Are you sure you want Japanese tea?

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:39.980
Yes.

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:43.670
She's quite different from what I had imagined.

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.680
She's neat and feminine.

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:54.730
They're ordinary tea leaves, but this is delicious.

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:56.740
She even heated the mugs.

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:03.760
Yamamoto-sensei, about Tsuchida-sensei...

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.180
What is it?

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:07.550
Nothing.

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:17.100
Hinagiku-chan, I'm glad you came to talk to me.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:23.050
Let's create more wonderful memories together at Hanamaru Kindergarten.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.630
Oh, yes.

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.680
This woman...

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:31.590
This woman...

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:35.950
I need to do something to protect Tsuchi from Hinagiku-chan.

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:38.010
To do that, we'll need to gather information first.

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:40.320
Hinagiku-chan is back.

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:45.830
I'm giving up on Tsuchida-sama.

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:50.800
I'm no match for Yamamoto-sensei.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:53.850
Hinagiku-chan.

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:56.480
You can relax now, Anzu-chan.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:01.030
Hinagiku-chan, you can't give up!

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:03.410
Anzu-chan.

00:20:03.940 --> 00:20:06.550
But compared to Yamamoto-sensei, I...

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:09.880
It's all over if you give up. Don't you love Tsuchi?

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:17.990
I'm not like Yamamoto-sensei yet, but soon I'll grow taller and develop breasts and be perfect for Tsuchi.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:22.740
I want to be with Tsuchi, so I'll never give up.

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:25.820
You've got to give it your best, too.

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:28.010
Anzu-chan...

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:38.760
Tsuchida-sama, we'll have to put our engagement on hold.

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:42.110
I love you.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:46.400
I'll do what I can to become the right woman for you.

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:48.200
I see.

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:54.330
Hinagiku-chan seems cheerful.

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:55.200
Yeah.

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:58.000
But that means your rival in love is back.

00:20:58.930 --> 00:21:00.490
You're right!

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:08.130
Hinagiku-chan? She's become even more friendly.

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:10.230
She's a very good girl.

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:12.850
That's for sure.

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:15.630
You're so popular with children, Tsuchida-kun.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:20.820
Kenji said you're only popular with kindergarten students, too.

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:23.460
Now that you mention it, you're right.

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:25.020
What do you mean, "only?"

00:21:25.520 --> 00:21:27.390
It's true, isn't it?

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:30.760
You too, Kakogawa-sensei? I just can't win.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:34.530
...which is why I passed up on this engagement.

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:39.870
Tsuchida-sama will have to wait until I'm older.

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.110
I see.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:43.960
You've matured, Hinagiku.

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:46.650
I've made some wonderful friends, too.

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:51.720
I'm grateful to you for allowing me to transfer to Hanamaru Kindergarten.

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:56.950
Hinagiku, I'll do anything for you!

00:21:57.570 --> 00:21:59.650
Oh, you!

00:23:30.490 --> 00:23:31.320
Anzu here!

00:23:31.320 --> 00:23:31.920
Hiiragi here.

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:32.560
Koume here.

00:23:32.560 --> 00:23:34.170
Aoi-chan was so cool.

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:36.400
I'm glad Hinagiku-chan cheered up.

00:23:36.400 --> 00:23:37.330
Your rival is back.

00:23:37.330 --> 00:23:39.340
That's fine. I won't give up.

00:23:39.340 --> 00:23:41.470
Next up we have a special guest.

00:23:41.470 --> 00:23:43.720
Next week's episode is about gifts and dreams.

00:23:42.300 --> 00:23:43.030
"A Hanamaru Gift"

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:43.860
"A Hanamaru Dream"

00:23:43.750 --> 00:23:44.830
Don't miss it.

00:23:44.010 --> 00:23:44.820
"A Hanamaru Night"

00:23:44.820 --> 00:23:49.470
"See you next week!"
